Assert for {cusku} seems unusual.  I can {cusku} a question but I don't
believe it's possible to assert a question.  {cusku} "express" vs. "say"
don't make a whole lot of difference to me either way.  I had the same
objection as Robin at first (that say and talk are very similar sounding)
until I really thought about how I use "say".

I have no problems with either as long as the user understands that it's a
GLOSS WORD and not some kind of official definition.

